{"suttaId":"tha-ap75","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4526,4538],"vripara":"9"},"segments":{"tha-ap75:0.3":"Buddhasaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap75:1.1":"“Dumagge paṃsukūlikaṃ,","tha-ap75:1.2":"laggaṃ disvāna satthuno;","tha-ap75:1.3":"Tato tamañjaliṃ katvā,","tha-ap75:1.4":"paṃsukūlaṃ avandahaṃ.","tha-ap75:2.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe,","tha-ap75:2.2":"yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap75:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap75:2.4":"buddhasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap75:3.1":"“Ito catutthake kappe,","tha-ap75:3.2":"dumasārosi khattiyo;","tha-ap75:3.3":"Cāturanto vijitāvī,","tha-ap75:3.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap75:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap75:4.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap75:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā buddhasaññako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap75:6.1":"Buddhasaññakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2671,"to":2671,"paras":[{"para":2671,"vripara":"9","refs":["tha-ap75:1"],"lines":["So pattaarahattādhigamo attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>dumagge paṃsukūlikan</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha dhunāti kampatīti dumo.","Duhati pūreti ākāsatalanti vā dumo, dumassa aggo koṭīti dumaggo, tasmiṃ dumagge.","Paṃsumiva paṭikkūlabhāvaṃ amanuññabhāvaṃ ulati gacchatīti paṃsukūlaṃ, paṃsukūlameva paṃsukūlikaṃ, satthuno paṃsukūlaṃ dumagge laggitaṃ disvā ahaṃ añjaliṃ paggahetvā taṃ paṃsukūlaṃ <b>avandiṃ</b> paṇāmamakāsinti attho.","<b>Tan</b>ti nipātamattaṃ.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap75:1"],["tha-ap75:1"],["tha-ap75:1"],["tha-ap75:1"],["tha-ap75:1"],["tha-ap75:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap75:1.1","dumagge paṃsukūlikaṃ",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
